  "Id": 3851,
  "Title": "Lilliane Angella Namala's Path to System Change",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "Lilliane's research and policy shift led to confident advocacy and real-world impact ",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClass31BA18270BD849AA85A9C3647859BE9A\"><p><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">When</span><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"apple-converted-space\" data-ccp-charstyle-defn=\"&#123;&quot;ObjectId&quot;&#58;&quot;2fd183b4-ad5c-5199-9fc7-89a6d0356079|1&quot;,&quot;ClassId&quot;&#58;1073872969,&quot;Properties&quot;&#58;[469777841,&quot;Arial&quot;,469777842,&quot;Arial&quot;,469777843,&quot;Arial&quot;,469777844,&quot;Arial&quot;,469769226,&quot;Arial&quot;,268442635,&quot;22&quot;,469775450,&quot;apple-converted-space&quot;,201340122,&quot;1&quot;,134233614,&quot;true&quot;,469778129,&quot;apple-converted-space&quot;,335572020,&quot;1&quot;,469778324,&quot;Default Paragraph Font&quot;]&#125;\"> </span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">Lilliane Angella </span><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">Namala</span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"apple-converted-space\"> </span><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"apple-converted-space\">,</span><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"apple-converted-space\"> a passionate classroom teacher with five years of experience in Uganda, </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">enrolled in the</span><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"apple-converted-space\"> </span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">Master of Education </span><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">(M.Ed.)</span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\"> </span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">in Leadership and Management</span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"apple-converted-space\"> </span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">part-time </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">programme</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> at the</span><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"apple-converted-space\"> </span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">Aga Khan University, Institute for Educational Development, East Africa (IED, EA)</span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"apple-converted-space\"> </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">in 2021, she was </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">seeking answers. </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">Wh</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">y</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">education</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">al</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> systems</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">facing</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> declining</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> performance</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">? W</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">as the solution </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">rooted in leadership, management, or policy?</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"&#123;&quot;134233117&quot;&#58;true,&quot;134233118&quot;&#58;true,&quot;201341983&quot;&#58;0,&quot;335559740&quot;&#58;240&#125;\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ccp-props=\"&#123;&quot;134233117&quot;&#58;true,&quot;134233118&quot;&#58;true,&quot;201341983&quot;&#58;0,&quot;335559740&quot;&#58;240&#125;\"></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">\"I joined IED, EA driven by a thirst for knowledge and a desire to understand the intersection between leadership, management, and educational reform,\" she reflects.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"&#123;&quot;134233117&quot;&#58;true,&quot;134233118&quot;&#58;true,&quot;201341983&quot;&#58;0,&quot;335559740&quot;&#58;240&#125;\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">Liliane i</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">nitially </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">explored </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">the</span><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"apple-converted-space\"> </span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">Early Childhood elective</span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">, </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">but she soon </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">realised</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> that understanding policy was the true key to influencing real change. She</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> transitioned </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">her focus </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">to</span><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"apple-converted-space\"> </span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">Policy Studies in Education</span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">. Th</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">is</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> shift allowed her to critically engage with Uganda's national education policies and strengthen her leadership perspective.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"&#123;&quot;134233117&quot;&#58;true,&quot;134233118&quot;&#58;true,&quot;201341983&quot;&#58;0,&quot;335559740&quot;&#58;240&#125;\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ccp-props=\"&#123;&quot;134233117&quot;&#58;true,&quot;134233118&quot;&#58;true,&quot;201341983&quot;&#58;0,&quot;335559740&quot;&#58;240&#125;\"></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">The</span><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"apple-converted-space\"> </span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">part-time structure</span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"apple-converted-space\"> </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">of the </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">M.Ed</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">programme</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">allowed</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> her to balance work, study, and advocacy</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">.</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> \"The </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">programme</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> nurtured my critical thinking, policy analysis, and practical problem-solving skills,\" she says. She credits</span><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"apple-converted-space\"> </span><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"apple-converted-space\">her </span><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"apple-converted-space\">lecture</span><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"apple-converted-space\"> and supervisor </span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">Dr</span><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\"> Tage</span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> for</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> providing</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> invaluable mentorship that </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">pushed her to apply her learning to real-world contexts, thinking</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> beyond academic boundaries</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"&#123;&quot;134233117&quot;&#58;true,&quot;134233118&quot;&#58;true,&quot;201341983&quot;&#58;0,&quot;335559740&quot;&#58;240&#125;\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ccp-props=\"&#123;&quot;134233117&quot;&#58;true,&quot;134233118&quot;&#58;true,&quot;201341983&quot;&#58;0,&quot;335559740&quot;&#58;240&#125;\"></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">One of her most impactful projects involved analyzing the</span><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"apple-converted-space\"> </span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">2019 National Teacher Policy in Uganda</span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">,</span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> which requires all teachers to hold a bachelor's degree. Th</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">is </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">study inspired her </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">to&#160;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> l</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">aunch</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> a</span><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"apple-converted-space\"> </span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">YouTube channel,</span><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"apple-converted-space\"> </span></span><a href=\"https&#58;//www.youtube.com/%40ChalkTalkUG\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Hyperlink\">Chalk Talk UG</span></span></a><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">, dedicated to advancing teacher development and promoting climate education.&#160;</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"&#123;&quot;134233117&quot;&#58;true,&quot;134233118&quot;&#58;true,&quot;201341983&quot;&#58;0,&quot;335559740&quot;&#58;240&#125;\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">\"That project showed me that research and advocacy can coexist</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">.\" </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">she</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> shares. \"L</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">earning at AKU inspired me to act</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">.</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">\"</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"&#123;&quot;134233117&quot;&#58;true,&quot;134233118&quot;&#58;true,&quot;201341983&quot;&#58;0,&quot;335559740&quot;&#58;240&#125;\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">Throughout </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">her studies</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">, Lilliane applied </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">her enhanced understanding of education policy and </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">evidence-based strategies to both </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">her </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">teaching and advocacy</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> work</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">. In her classroom, she introduced active learning and critical reflection techniques</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">.</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> Mean</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">while</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">,</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> her online platform became a</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> vital</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> tool for professional development and climate awareness among teachers and students alike.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"&#123;&quot;134233117&quot;&#58;true,&quot;134233118&quot;&#58;true,&quot;201341983&quot;&#58;0,&quot;335559740&quot;&#58;240&#125;\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">Balancing her multiple roles was </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">a challenge,</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> but the </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">programme</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> instilled</span><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"apple-converted-space\"> </span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">discipline, resilience, and confidence</span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">. </span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">\"It awakened potential beyond academics</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">.</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> AKU taught me to lead, innovate, and influence positive change,\" she says.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"&#123;&quot;134233117&quot;&#58;true,&quot;134233118&quot;&#58;true,&quot;201341983&quot;&#58;0,&quot;335559740&quot;&#58;240&#125;\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ccp-props=\"&#123;&quot;134233117&quot;&#58;true,&quot;134233118&quot;&#58;true,&quot;201341983&quot;&#58;0,&quot;335559740&quot;&#58;240&#125;\"></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">Today, Lilliane continues to </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">use her </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">M.Ed</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">learning to strengthen Uganda's education system through research and advocacy. Her journey</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> proves</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\"> how </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">the</span><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"apple-converted-space\"> </span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\"> part</span><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">-time </span><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">programme</span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"apple-converted-space\"> </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">empowers </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">working </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">educators to grow both professionally and personally without stepping away from their calling to serve.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"&#123;&quot;134233117&quot;&#58;true,&quot;134233118&quot;&#58;true,&quot;201341983&quot;&#58;0,&quot;335559740&quot;&#58;240&#125;\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ccp-props=\"&#123;&quot;134233117&quot;&#58;true,&quot;134233118&quot;&#58;true,&quot;201341983&quot;&#58;0,&quot;335559740&quot;&#58;240&#125;\"></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">\"I encourage all educators and school leaders to pursue the MEd part-time </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">programme</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">,\" she advises</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">. </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">\"</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">It empowers working professionals to think critically, lead confidently, and make meaningful impact in their communities.\"</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"&#123;&quot;134233117&quot;&#58;true,&quot;134233118&quot;&#58;true,&quot;201341983&quot;&#58;0,&quot;335559740&quot;&#58;240&#125;\">&#160;</span></p></div>",
